    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολάμπ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἥλιος εἰς τὰς παστάδας ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.8.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὰ ὄμματα
			καθεύδοντος,</span> of a lion, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.670c
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέφρῃ πῦρ ὑπολαμπόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.80
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>begin to shine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς τὸ ἔαρ ὑπέλαμπε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.190
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				8.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕως ὑ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἡ ἡμέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					49
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὸ ἦθος ταῖς παρειαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.87
				</span></i>
			.</div>
